	(text "RTC: DS3231M (+/-5 ppm, MEMS resonator, no crystal) at I2C 0x68.\nVCC from 3V3 when on; VBAT from VBACKUP (always-on 3.0 V LDO, optional CR1220) when off.\nINT/SQW (open drain) -> P4 GPIO13 (LP GPIO: alarm wake-up from deep sleep).\nOPTIONAL (DNP): the OSPTEK module has RTC_VBAT on VBACKUP, so the P4 RTC keeps time. Fit U701/C701/C702\nfor a +/-5 ppm clock (Q27). R701 stays fitted (RTC_INT pull-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 165.1 0)
		(effects
